    </profile>
    <profile name="Sunrifle" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="50ed-f656-a2d3-3b26">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b9e-0c24-e409-a801">24"</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Str." typeId="1ebc-896c-43de-904a">3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="730c-47dc-fdad-3c8b">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Assault 6, Pinning</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c" />
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Tempest Launcher" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="d7cd-6da1-dcf2-33aa">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b9e-0c24-e409-a801">36"</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Str." typeId="1ebc-896c-43de-904a">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="730c-47dc-fdad-3c8b">3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Heavy 2, Blast, Barrage</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c" />
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Triskele" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="c257-5d80-59dc-2cf9">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b9e-0c24-e409-a801">12"</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Str." typeId="1ebc-896c-43de-904a">3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="730c-47dc-fdad-3c8b">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Assault 3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c">This weapon also counts as a power weapon.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Vibro Cannon" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="42b5-3fa8-fd69-06e5">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b9e-0c24-e409-a801">36"</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Str." typeId="1ebc-896c-43de-904a">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="730c-47dc-fdad-3c8b">-</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Heavy 1, Pinning</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c">When firing a Vibro Cannon, roll to hit (the firer does not need to pick a target) if any of the Vibro cannons hit, draw a single 36" straight line from one Vibro cannon in any direction. Any unit which the line passes through suffers D6 hits. For each Vibro cannon in the battery after the first, add 1 to the strength of these hits. A target with an Armour value that is hit by a vibro cannon always suffer a single glancing hit; do not roll for armour penetration.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Wraithcannon" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="2e4a-759a-78fe-ad85">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b9e-0c24-e409-a801">12"</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Str." typeId="1ebc-896c-43de-904a">x</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="730c-47dc-fdad-3c8b">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Assault 1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c">The Wraithcannon always wounds on a 2+, and a roll to wound of 6 inflicts instant death. Againsts vehicles, a warithcannon always inflicts a glancing hit on a 3 or 4 and a penetrating hit on a 5 or 6.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Forceshield" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear" hidden="false" id="d22a-e1bb-dbd6-b516">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">Grants the bearer a 4+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Haywire Grenades" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear" hidden="false" id="49d2-85d6-9995-2583">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">A model attacking with these grenades may only make a single attack. If it hits, roll a D6 to determine the effect: 


1 - No effect


2-5 - Glancing Hit


6 - Penetrating Hit</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Master Strategist" typeId="ccb3-7790-3139-7975" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="e419-7f8e-7b40-28e4">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="e24a-6018-20cf-d76c">Any Eldar army including one or more Autarchs, you may choose to add 1 to your rolls for reserves (A roll of 1 always counts as a failure).</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Banshee mask" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear" hidden="false" id="e08f-bb4c-89f8-496a">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">In the first round of an assault a model wearing a Banshee mask has Initiative 10 and negates any Initiative bonus conferred by cover and grenades.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Warp Jump Generator" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear" hidden="false" id="0ce7-0a3b-08e1-a0d6">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">A unit with a warp jump generator moves as if it was equipped with a jump pack. if unengaged, the unit may make a second jump during the assault phase instead of assaulting. Nominate the direction the unit is jumping in and move it up to 2D6" in this direction. Any model finishing its move in impassable terrain is destroyed. If you roll a double, one member of the unit has been claimed by the Warp and is removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Mandiblasters" typeId="1d88-1369-f0ed-b39c" typeName="Melee Weapons" hidden="false" id="1219-1c68-6a82-b394">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">A model with mandiblasters has +1 A.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Ghosthelm" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear" hidden="false" id="a44a-6c86-57a8-b3cd">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">If a Farseer suffers a Perils of the Warp attack, his Ghosthelm will prevent it on a D6 roll of 3+.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Rune Armour" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear" hidden="false" id="6d20-f315-c90f-8850">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">The bearer gains a 4+ Invulnerable save.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Spiritseet" typeId="ccb3-7790-3139-7975" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="4eba-d802-81e0-644e">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="e24a-6018-20cf-d76c">Any Wraithlord or Wraithguard unit with a model within 12" of a Spiritseer need not test for Wraithsight.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Conceal" typeId="8c68-ad11-33db-e3c4" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="0e7f-1bf2-7bf4-f188">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power" typeId="1638-2569-4ea3-9b0a">The Warlock's whole squad receives a 5+ Cover Save. This does not count as occupying cover for the purposes of assault.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Destructor" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="5a25-42f8-99b9-744c">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b9e-0c24-e409-a801">Template</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Str." typeId="1ebc-896c-43de-904a">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="730c-47dc-fdad-3c8b">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Assault 1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c" />
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Embolden" typeId="8c68-ad11-33db-e3c4" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="9231-7d9c-5717-f72d">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power" typeId="1638-2569-4ea3-9b0a">The Warlock and his squad may re-roll any failed Leadership tests.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Enhance" typeId="8c68-ad11-33db-e3c4" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="d7ae-b2cd-f69b-41e3">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power" typeId="1638-2569-4ea3-9b0a">All models in the same unit as the Warlock, including the Warlock itself, add +1 to their Weapon Skill and Initiative. The effects of multiple Enhance powers are not cumulative.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Runes of Warding" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear" hidden="false" id="a533-3584-4847-4d9e">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">All enemy Psychic tests must be taken on 3D6, suffering a Perils of the Warp attack on any roll of 12 or above.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Runes of Witnessing" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear" hidden="false" id="68f7-d23e-0003-f5da">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">A Farseer with runes of witnessing rolls 3D6 and discards the highest roll when taking a Psychic test. You must use the lowest two rolls.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Spirit Stones" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear" hidden="false" id="69dc-1c6c-deb2-375d">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">A Farseer with spirit stones can use two psychic powers per turn. A Farseer cannot use the same psychic power twice in the same turn.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Doom" typeId="8c68-ad11-33db-e3c4" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="e532-a72d-30b4-07c7">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power" typeId="1638-2569-4ea3-9b0a">The Farseer can target any non-vehicle unit within 24". All hits caused upon that unit gain a re-roll to wound until the start of the next Eldar turn.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Eldritch Storm" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="4526-37a8-2771-ea9e">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b9e-0c24-e409-a801">18"</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Str." typeId="1ebc-896c-43de-904a">3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="730c-47dc-fdad-3c8b">-</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Large Blast, Pinning</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c">The Eldar player places the Large blast marker centred on an enemy model within 18". Vehicles touched by the template suffer a hit with 2D6+3 armour penetration and are spun around to face in a direction determined by the scatter dice - if a hit is rolled, the Eldar player may choose its facing.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Fortune" typeId="8c68-ad11-33db-e3c4" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="d310-768f-edc0-1851">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power" typeId="1638-2569-4ea3-9b0a">Nominate one Eldar unit with a model within 6" of the Farseer. This unit re-rolls any failed saves it makes until the start of the next Eldar turn.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Guide" typeId="8c68-ad11-33db-e3c4" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="7d0a-f869-4ba3-d77c">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power" typeId="1638-2569-4ea3-9b0a">Nominate one Eldar unit with a model within 6" of the Farseer. This unit re-rolls any failed to hit rolls made in that turn's shooting phase. If the unit is using a barrage weapon (such as a D-cannon) you may re-roll their scatter dice instead.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Mind War" typeId="8c68-ad11-33db-e3c4" typeName="Psychic Power" hidden="false" id="b085-0826-4130-759a">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power" typeId="1638-2569-4ea3-9b0a">This psychic power is used in the shooting phase instead of a weapon. The Eldar player may choose any unengaged model within 18" of the Farseer and within his line of sight (models mounted in vehicles cannot be targeted). Both players roll a D6 and add the Leadership of their respective models. For each point the Farseer wins by, the target loses a wound, with no armour saves allowed.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Wrist-mounted Avenger Shuriken Catapults" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="0f18-d71c-4959-5577">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b9e-0c24-e409-a801">18"</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Str." typeId="1ebc-896c-43de-904a">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="730c-47dc-fdad-3c8b">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Assault 4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c" />
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Bladestorm" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="5330-f7e5-6561-5746">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">The Exarch and his squad may choose to add one to the number of shots they each fire with their Shuriken weapons that turn. If they do so they may not fire in the subsequent shooting phase as they reload.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Defend" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="a8a7-0b93-5bdc-ce5c">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">Enemy models directing their attacks towards the Exarch's squad lose one Attack in each assault phase (to a minimum of 1)</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="War Shout" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="9f30-2738-6be2-fccf">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">In the first round of an assault, any enemy unit she or her squad is fighting must pass a Morale test or count as having WS1 for the rest of that assault phase.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Acrobatic" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="4a27-edc9-6fbb-7f3e">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">This unit has the Counter-Attack special rule.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Tank Hunters" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="3151-3abf-952c-8046">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">The Exarch and his squad have the Tank Hunter ability.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Crack Shot" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="6eb5-0805-00c4-cb1b">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">The enemy may not make cover saves against shots from the Exarch, and the Exarch may re-roll any failed to wound rolls when shooting.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Shadowstrike" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="abfd-8e97-eda9-89b2">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">A squad including a model with Shadowstrike has the Infiltrate special rule. This ability cannot affect and Autarch</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Stalker" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="c50d-564f-0bda-2327">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">This unit has the Move Through Cover special rule.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Fast Shot" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="1e50-f4b0-d60a-6158">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">The Exarch may add +1 to the number of shots fired by his weapon (for example, Heavy 2 becomes Heavy 3). Fast Shot may not be used by an Exarch in the same turn as he used Crack Shot.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Skyleap" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="111d-993e-7705-4f5d">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">The player may elect to remove a unit with Skyleap from the table in its movement phase, placing it in reserve. If the squad was engaged in combat, the enemy may then Deep Strike back into play from their following turn, exactly as if they had been held in reserve from the beginning of the game (even in missions that do not allow Deep Strike or reserves). For example, if they are removed from the table on turn 2, they will re-enter play on turn 3 on the roll of a 3+.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Intercept" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="bf0d-a365-5a90-b051">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">In assaults, they never require worse than 4+ to hit vehicles that do not have a WS.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Surprise Assault" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="0035-71f9-cc53-d5c1">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">The Exarch and his squad may always use the Deep Strike rule, regardless of the mission being played.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Withdraw" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="27fb-830a-f3ca-e7ea">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">The Exarch's unit has the Hit and Run special rule.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Skilled Rider" typeId="56e3-7b0a-703a-e89d" typeName="Exarch Power" hidden="false" id="4e93-8dc5-3b3b-7ac9">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="30bc-cf7e-dc4a-3be1">The Exarch and his unit have the Skilled Rider ability.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Diresword" typeId="1d88-1369-f0ed-b39c" typeName="Melee Weapons" hidden="false" id="3a02-77ac-d2ac-9459">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">A Diresword is a power weapon. In addition, if a model suffers any unsaved wounds from a diresword, it must immediately pass a Leadership test for each wound suffered. If any of these tests are failed, the victim dies automatically and is removed regardless of remaining wounds.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Shimmershield" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear" hidden="false" id="cbfa-0ca4-202a-a591">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">A model with a Shimmershield, and all members of his unit, will benefit from a 5+ invulnerable save in close combat.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Executioner" typeId="1d88-1369-f0ed-b39c" typeName="Melee Weapons" hidden="false" id="aa81-c3d5-3e71-9571">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">This is a two-handed power weapon that adds +2 S.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Mirrorswords" typeId="1d88-1369-f0ed-b39c" typeName="Melee Weapons" hidden="false" id="a87f-9c82-c302-1a26">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">A model with mirrorswords counts as having an extra hand weapon that grants +2 A instead of the usual +1 A. Mirrorswords ignore armour saves. Uses both hands</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Scorpion's Claw" typeId="1d88-1369-f0ed-b39c" typeName="Melee Weapons" hidden="false" id="e895-bcf0-d9d5-6c2e">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">This weapon counts as both a Power Fist and a Shuriken catapult.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Scorpion Chainsword" typeId="1d88-1369-f0ed-b39c" typeName="Melee Weapons" hidden="false" id="a2c5-4bc2-47b4-0a53">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">This is a one-handed weapon that adds +1 S to the model's attacks.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Chainsabres" typeId="1d88-1369-f0ed-b39c" typeName="Melee Weapons" hidden="false" id="9a05-9aa2-475d-bf3f">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">A model with chainsabres has +1 Attack and can re-roll all failed to hit and to wound rolls.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Biting Blade" typeId="1d88-1369-f0ed-b39c" typeName="Melee Weapons" hidden="false" id="175f-7b4c-b754-a245">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">This is a two-handed close combat weapon that adds +1 S. Furthermore, each hit scored by a model with a biting blade adds a further +1S for the purposes of resolving those attacks. For example, an Exarch who hits three times will strike at S7</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Swooping Hawk Wings" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear" hidden="false" id="c8c2-a007-e987-c28b">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">A model with Swooping Hawk wings moves as if equipped with a jump pack and may use the Deep Strike rules to deploy in missions that allow it.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Swooping Hawk Grenade Pack" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="dbc3-0720-b3e9-7840">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="9b9e-0c24-e409-a801">n/a</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Str." typeId="1ebc-896c-43de-904a">4</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="AP" typeId="730c-47dc-fdad-3c8b">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Type" typeId="1524-30c8-5da7-66ff">Large Blast</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="45fd-0f50-e1d0-907c">Any time a Swooping Hawk unit uses its Deep Strike ability, it may place a Large Blast Marker centred on an enemy model anywhere on the table and roll a scatter dice. If an arrow is rolled, the marker scatters D6" in the indicated direction. Work out hits and damage as normal.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Powerblades" typeId="1d88-1369-f0ed-b39c" typeName="Melee Weapons" hidden="false" id="d8bb-9bf6-743f-f535">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">Powerblades confer +1 A and ignore armour saves.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Star Lance" typeId="1d88-1369-f0ed-b39c" typeName="Melee Weapons" hidden="false" id="9a00-5c10-88e5-14ed">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Ability" typeId="2113-98a2-4376-a94c">This weapon follows the same rules for a Laser Lance, but has a Strength of 8 in all cases.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="The Silent Death" typeId="8e6f-7553-28c5-95a0" typeName="Weapons" hidden="false" id="080f-7ac0-0563-d02c">
